reated• Report approvers can view and delete all expenses in reports they approve• Delete operations check creator ownership and report status• Expenses cannot be deleted if report status is Submitted, Approved, FinanceApproved, or ProcessedOperations supported:• GET: Retrieve expenses with filtering and sorting capabilities (includes child data)• POST: Create new expense entries with type-specific validation• PUT: Update existing expenses (amounts, descriptions, status, etc.)• DELETE: Delete expense entries (validates authorization and report status)• POST (Service Operation): DeleteExpenses - Bulk delete multiple expenses with authorization checksSpecial Features:• DeleteExpenses: Bulk delete with proper child data cleanup and detailed failure reporting• Type-specific validation for mileage and per diem expenses• Automatic currency conversion support• Project and category association for detailed reporting• Business Component (BC) pattern ensures data integrity and proper child deletionFor more information about the ExpenseManagement functionality in Exact Online, see Work with expense management.
